  "title": "VALHI ANNOUNCES EXPECTED FIRST QUARTER 2026 EARNINGS RELEASE DATE",
  "summary": "Dallas, Texas, April 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Valhi, Inc. (NYSE: VHI) announced today that, subject to the completion of quarter-end closing procedures, it expects to report first quarter 2026 earnings in a press release after market close on Thursday, May 7, 2026. Valhi, Inc.",
